{"id":"c8e718c83a9cc331","group":"91","path":"91/91-df-structure.md","title":"结构","display":"df-structure — 结构","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-df-structure","aliases":["91-df-structure","91-df-model-structure"],"display":"df-structure — 结构","depends_on":["[[91-df-ground-language]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-df-structure"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-df-structure</span><span>91-df-model-structure</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-structure — 结构"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"2ad7561edabb2148\" href=\"?note=2ad7561edabb2148\" title=\"91-df-ground-language\">91-df-ground-language</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"df-structure-—-结构-$\\mathfrak{M}$\">df-structure — 结构 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak{M}\">\\(\\mathfrak{M}\\)</span></h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{L}\">\\(\\mathcal{L}\\)</span> (一阶形式语言)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Const}_{\\mathcal L}\">\\(\\mathrm{Const}_{\\mathcal L}\\)</span> (常量符号集合)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Fun}^{n}_{\\mathcal L}\">\\(\\mathrm{Fun}^{n}_{\\mathcal L}\\)</span> (<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 元函数符号集合)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Rel}^{n}_{\\mathcal L}\">\\(\\mathrm{Rel}^{n}_{\\mathcal L}\\)</span> (<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 元关系符号集合)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Var}_{\\mathcal L}\">\\(\\mathrm{Var}_{\\mathcal L}\\)</span> (变元集合)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Term}_{\\mathcal L},\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathcal L},\n\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L}\">\\(\\mathrm{Term}_{\\mathcal L},\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathcal L},\n\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L}\\)</span> (项、公式与句子的句法类)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}structure}\\vdash\n(D,I)\\in\\operatorname{Str}(\\mathcal L)\\quad\\Longleftrightarrow\\quad&amp;\nD\\ne\\varnothing\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall c\\in\\mathrm{Const}_{\\mathcal L}\\;(I(c)\\in D)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\,\\forall f\\in\\mathrm{Fun}^{n}_{\\mathcal L}\\;\n(I(f):D^n\\to D)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\,\\forall R\\in\\mathrm{Rel}^{n}_{\\mathcal L}\\;\n(I(R)\\subseteq D^n).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}structure}\\vdash\n(D,I)\\in\\operatorname{Str}(\\mathcal L)\\quad\\Longleftrightarrow\\quad&amp;\nD\\ne\\varnothing\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall c\\in\\mathrm{Const}_{\\mathcal L}\\;(I(c)\\in D)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\,\\forall f\\in\\mathrm{Fun}^{n}_{\\mathcal L}\\;\n(I(f):D^n\\to D)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\,\\forall R\\in\\mathrm{Rel}^{n}_{\\mathcal L}\\;\n(I(R)\\subseteq D^n).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak M=(D,I)\\in\\operatorname{Str}(\\mathcal L)\">\\(\\mathfrak M=(D,I)\\in\\operatorname{Str}(\\mathcal L)\\)</span> 且\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Asn}_{\\mathfrak M}\\coloneqq\nD^{\\mathrm{Var}_{\\mathcal L}}\">\\(\\operatorname{Asn}_{\\mathfrak M}\\coloneqq\nD^{\\mathrm{Var}_{\\mathcal L}}\\)</span>。项解释与满足关系是满足下列递归子句的\n唯一函数/关系：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\llbracket x\\rrbracket_{\\mathfrak M,s}&amp;=s(x),&amp;\n\\llbracket c\\rrbracket_{\\mathfrak M,s}&amp;=I(c),\\\\\n\\llbracket f(t_1,\\ldots,t_n)\\rrbracket_{\\mathfrak M,s}\n&amp;=I(f)(\\llbracket t_1\\rrbracket_{\\mathfrak M,s},\\ldots,\n\\llbracket t_n\\rrbracket_{\\mathfrak M,s}),\\\\\n\\mathfrak M,s\\models R(t_1,\\ldots,t_n)\n&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n(\\llbracket t_1\\rrbracket_{\\mathfrak M,s},\\ldots,\n\\llbracket t_n\\rrbracket_{\\mathfrak M,s})\\in I(R),\\\\\n\\mathfrak M,s\\models(t_1=t_2)\n&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\llbracket t_1\\rrbracket_{\\mathfrak M,s}\n=\\llbracket t_2\\rrbracket_{\\mathfrak M,s},\\\\\n\\mathfrak M,s\\models\\neg\\varphi\n&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathfrak M,s\\not\\models\\varphi,\\\\\n\\mathfrak M,s\\models(\\varphi\\land\\psi)\n&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n(\\mathfrak M,s\\models\\varphi\\land\\mathfrak M,s\\models\\psi),\\\\\n\\mathfrak M,s\\models\\exists x\\,\\varphi\n&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists d\\in D\\;(\\mathfrak M,s[x\\mapsto d]\\models\\varphi).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\llbracket x\\rrbracket_{\\mathfrak M,s}&amp;=s(x),&amp;\n\\llbracket c\\rrbracket_{\\mathfrak M,s}&amp;=I(c),\\\\\n\\llbracket f(t_1,\\ldots,t_n)\\rrbracket_{\\mathfrak M,s}\n&amp;=I(f)(\\llbracket t_1\\rrbracket_{\\mathfrak M,s},\\ldots,\n\\llbracket t_n\\rrbracket_{\\mathfrak M,s}),\\\\\n\\mathfrak M,s\\models R(t_1,\\ldots,t_n)\n&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n(\\llbracket t_1\\rrbracket_{\\mathfrak M,s},\\ldots,\n\\llbracket t_n\\rrbracket_{\\mathfrak M,s})\\in I(R),\\\\\n\\mathfrak M,s\\models(t_1=t_2)\n&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\llbracket t_1\\rrbracket_{\\mathfrak M,s}\n=\\llbracket t_2\\rrbracket_{\\mathfrak M,s},\\\\\n\\mathfrak M,s\\models\\neg\\varphi\n&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathfrak M,s\\not\\models\\varphi,\\\\\n\\mathfrak M,s\\models(\\varphi\\land\\psi)\n&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n(\\mathfrak M,s\\models\\varphi\\land\\mathfrak M,s\\models\\psi),\\\\\n\\mathfrak M,s\\models\\exists x\\,\\varphi\n&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists d\\in D\\;(\\mathfrak M,s[x\\mapsto d]\\models\\varphi).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其余经典联结词按定义展开；对\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L}\">\\(\\sigma\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L}\\)</span> 与\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L}\">\\(\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L}\\)</span>，</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak M\\models\\sigma\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall s\\in\\operatorname{Asn}_{\\mathfrak M}\\,\n(\\mathfrak M,s\\models\\sigma),\n\\qquad\n\\mathfrak M\\models\\Gamma\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall\\sigma\\in\\Gamma\\,(\\mathfrak M\\models\\sigma).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathfrak M\\models\\sigma\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall s\\in\\operatorname{Asn}_{\\mathfrak M}\\,\n(\\mathfrak M,s\\models\\sigma),\n\\qquad\n\\mathfrak M\\models\\Gamma\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall\\sigma\\in\\Gamma\\,(\\mathfrak M\\models\\sigma).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak{M}\">\\(\\mathfrak{M}\\)</span> : 结构（structure）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D\">\\(D\\)</span> 或 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|\\mathfrak{M}|\">\\(|\\mathfrak{M}|\\)</span> : 论域（domain）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\">\\(I\\)</span> : 按符号类别与元数分型的解释</li>\n</ul>\n<p>说明：结构是模型论的基本对象，由论域和解释函数组成。结构为语言中的符号提供语义内容。</p>\n<p>结构的组成部分：</p>\n<div class=\"table-scroll\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"表格\"><table><thead>\n<tr>\n<th>成分</th>\n<th>符号</th>\n<th>解释</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>论域</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D\">\\(D\\)</span>, $</td>\n<td>\\mathfrak{M}</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>常量解释</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I(c) \\in D\">\\(I(c) \\in D\\)</span></td>\n<td>常量符号的值</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>函数解释</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I(f) : D^n \\to D\">\\(I(f) : D^n \\to D\\)</span></td>\n<td>函数符号的解释</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>关系解释</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I(R) \\subseteq D^n\">\\(I(R) \\subseteq D^n\\)</span></td>\n<td>关系符号的外延</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></div><p>标准算术结构：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak{N} = (\\mathbb{N}, I_0)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathfrak{N} = (\\mathbb{N}, I_0)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其中：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb{N} = \\{0, 1, 2, ...\\}\">\\(\\mathbb{N} = \\{0, 1, 2, ...\\}\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I_0(0) = 0\">\\(I_0(0) = 0\\)</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I_0(S)(n)=n+1\">\\(I_0(S)(n)=n+1\\)</span></li>\n<li>$I_0(+) $是标准加法</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I_0(\\times)\">\\(I_0(\\times)\\)</span>是标准乘法</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I_0(&lt;)\">\\(I_0(&lt;)\\)</span>是标准小于关系</li>\n</ul>\n<p>结构的扩张：\n给定结构<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak{M}\">\\(\\mathfrak{M}\\)</span>和语言<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{L}&#39; \\supseteq \\mathcal{L}\">\\(\\mathcal{L}&#39; \\supseteq \\mathcal{L}\\)</span>，扩张结构：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak{M}&#39; = (D, I&#39;)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathfrak{M}&#39; = (D, I&#39;)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其中<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I&#39;\">\\(I&#39;\\)</span>扩展<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\">\\(I\\)</span>到新符号。</p>\n<p>真理理论中的应用：</p>\n<div class=\"table-scroll\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"表格\"><table><thead>\n<tr>\n<th>结构</th>\n<th>语言</th>\n<th>应用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak{M}_0\">\\(\\mathfrak{M}_0\\)</span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{L}_0\">\\(\\mathcal{L}_0\\)</span></td>\n<td>基础算术模型</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak{M}_T\">\\(\\mathfrak{M}_T\\)</span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{L}_T\">\\(\\mathcal{L}_T\\)</span></td>\n<td>真理扩展模型</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak{M}_{\\infty}\">\\(\\mathfrak{M}_{\\infty}\\)</span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{L}_T\">\\(\\mathcal{L}_T\\)</span></td>\n<td>固定点模型</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></div><p>结构与模型的关系：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak M\\models\\Gamma\">\\(\\mathfrak M\\models\\Gamma\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak M\">\\(\\mathfrak M\\)</span> 是理论 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\">\\(\\Gamma\\)</span> 的模型。</li>\n<li>“句法一致当且仅当存在模型”依赖一阶逻辑完备性定理及通常的可形式化\n证明系统假设；它不是仅由“结构”的定义直接得到的等价式。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>定义的意义：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>提供模型论的基础概念</li>\n<li>区分语法和语义层面</li>\n<li>为真理扩展提供结构框架</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"df-structure-—-结构-$\\mathfrak{M}$","text":"df-structure — 结构 $\\mathfrak{M}$","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-df-ground-language","status":"resolved","id":"2ad7561edabb2148","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-ground-language]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathfrak{M}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal{L}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Const}_{\\mathcal L}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Fun}^{n}_{\\mathcal L}","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Rel}^{n}_{\\mathcal L}","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Var}_{\\mathcal L}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Term}_{\\mathcal L},\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathcal L},\n\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}structure}\\vdash\n(D,I)\\in\\operatorname{Str}(\\mathcal L)\\quad\\Longleftrightarrow\\quad&\nD\\ne\\varnothing\\\\\n&{}\\land\\forall c\\in\\mathrm{Const}_{\\mathcal L}\\;(I(c)\\in D)\\\\\n&{}\\land\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\,\\forall f\\in\\mathrm{Fun}^{n}_{\\mathcal L}\\;\n(I(f):D^n\\to D)\\\\\n&{}\\land\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\,\\forall R\\in\\mathrm{Rel}^{n}_{\\mathcal L}\\;\n(I(R)\\subseteq D^n).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathfrak M=(D,I)\\in\\operatorname{Str}(\\mathcal L)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Asn}_{\\mathfrak M}\\coloneqq\nD^{\\mathrm{Var}_{\\mathcal L}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\llbracket x\\rrbracket_{\\mathfrak M,s}&=s(x),&\n\\llbracket c\\rrbracket_{\\mathfrak M,s}&=I(c),\\\\\n\\llbracket f(t_1,\\ldots,t_n)\\rrbracket_{\\mathfrak M,s}\n&=I(f)(\\llbracket t_1\\rrbracket_{\\mathfrak M,s},\\ldots,\n\\llbracket t_n\\rrbracket_{\\mathfrak M,s}),\\\\\n\\mathfrak M,s\\models R(t_1,\\ldots,t_n)\n&\\Longleftrightarrow\n(\\llbracket t_1\\rrbracket_{\\mathfrak M,s},\\ldots,\n\\llbracket t_n\\rrbracket_{\\mathfrak M,s})\\in I(R),\\\\\n\\mathfrak M,s\\models(t_1=t_2)\n&\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\llbracket t_1\\rrbracket_{\\mathfrak M,s}\n=\\llbracket t_2\\rrbracket_{\\mathfrak M,s},\\\\\n\\mathfrak M,s\\models\\neg\\varphi\n&\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathfrak M,s\\not\\models\\varphi,\\\\\n\\mathfrak M,s\\models(\\varphi\\land\\psi)\n&\\Longleftrightarrow\n(\\mathfrak M,s\\models\\varphi\\land\\mathfrak M,s\\models\\psi),\\\\\n\\mathfrak M,s\\models\\exists x\\,\\varphi\n&\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists d\\in D\\;(\\mathfrak M,s[x\\mapsto d]\\models\\varphi).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\sigma\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathfrak M\\models\\sigma\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall s\\in\\operatorname{Asn}_{\\mathfrak M}\\,\n(\\mathfrak M,s\\models\\sigma),\n\\qquad\n\\mathfrak M\\models\\Gamma\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall\\sigma\\in\\Gamma\\,(\\mathfrak M\\models\\sigma).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathfrak{M}","display":false},{"tex":"D","display":false},{"tex":"|\\mathfrak{M}|","display":false},{"tex":"I","display":false},{"tex":"D","display":false},{"tex":"I(c) \\in D","display":false},{"tex":"I(f) : D^n \\to D","display":false},{"tex":"I(R) \\subseteq D^n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathfrak{N} = (\\mathbb{N}, I_0)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathbb{N} = \\{0, 1, 2, ...\\}","display":false},{"tex":"I_0(0) = 0","display":false},{"tex":"I_0(S)(n)=n+1","display":false},{"tex":"I_0(\\times)","display":false},{"tex":"I_0(<)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathfrak{M}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal{L}' \\supseteq \\mathcal{L}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathfrak{M}' = (D, I')","display":true},{"tex":"I'","display":false},{"tex":"I","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathfrak{M}_0","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal{L}_0","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathfrak{M}_T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal{L}_T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathfrak{M}_{\\infty}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal{L}_T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathfrak M\\models\\Gamma","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathfrak M","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma","display":false}],"bytes":4374,"backlinks":[{"id":"23ed499f8d7c6524","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"253f996295270684","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"f088119b0602bcd0","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"7f5043d4200f56d1","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"]